    {
      "title": "Agent Prompt Guide",
      "content": "$1e"
    },
    {
      "title": "Rainbow Accent Palette (Decorative Only)",
      "content": "The site also includes a set of vivid decorative stroke colors that appear in SVG illustrations and icon accents: #ff0000 (red), #9500ff (violet), #ff5d00 (orange), #fffb00 (yellow), #00f70c (green), #ff00d5 (pink). These are NEVER to be used for text, buttons, or functional UI — they exist only as decorative SVG strokes for illustrations and graphical accents. If an illustration calls for a rainbow effect, pull from this set. If the design needs a functional color, use the disciplined teal/pink/lavender system from the core palette."
    }
  ],
